    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>Tiny interlocking gears fill this copper amulet, driven by magic drawn from Mechanus, the plane of clockwork predictability. It ticks and whirs softly.</p><p>When you make an attack roll while wearing the amulet, you can choose not to roll the d20 and take a 10 on the die instead. Once you use this property, you can’t use it again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-6vXi6k3tm9U6QAuC\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Le 10 sur le d20 se règle à la main (pas de jet) ; l’activité <em>Clockwork Precision</em> compte l’utilisation, rendue à l’aube.</p></section>",
